<title>FRANCE: Air Liquide 9-month sales up 6.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Air Liquide 9-month sales up 6.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					24,828    vs   23,408</p>
<p>     - gas					  18,099    vs   17,479</p>
<p>     - soldering				   2,766    vs    2,690</p>
<p>     - engineering and construction	  1,139    vs	671</p>
<p>     - chemical and other			2,823    vs    2,565</p>
<p>Note - Air Liquide said in a statement that on a like for like basis, sales rose 4.9 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
